38
00:01:23,200 --> 00:01:24,920
You don't need anyone's forgiveness.

39
00:01:25,640 --> 00:01:26,520
You again.

40
00:01:30,240 --> 00:01:30,760
Cheng Lin.

41
00:01:33,840 --> 00:01:34,480
I looked you up.

42
00:01:35,280 --> 00:01:37,080
You've only been out of juvie
for two months.

43
00:01:37,280 --> 00:01:37,720
Right?

44
00:01:41,760 --> 00:01:42,280
What are you after?

45
00:01:43,160 --> 00:01:43,960
Her money?

46
00:01:45,920 --> 00:01:46,680
I'll pay you.

47
00:01:47,440 --> 00:01:47,960
Is that enough?

48
00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:50,640
How about now?

49
00:01:50,880 --> 00:01:51,790
- Duan Cizhou, you...
- Take it.

50
00:01:52,160 --> 00:01:52,880
Take it all!

51
00:01:53,400 --> 00:01:53,840
Get lost!

52
00:02:12,000 --> 00:02:12,560
Let her go!

53
00:02:12,560 --> 00:02:13,200
You let go!

54
00:02:13,640 --> 00:02:14,600
Both of you, let go of me!

55
00:02:17,520 --> 00:02:18,120
Su Yan.

56
00:02:22,280 --> 00:02:22,720
Su Yan.

57
00:02:24,120 --> 00:02:24,520
Su Yan.

58
00:02:25,360 --> 00:02:25,840
Su Yan.

59
00:02:26,360 --> 00:02:26,840
Su Yan.

60
00:02:27,480 --> 00:02:27,720
I...

61
