Why are you following me?

62
00:02:29,800 --> 00:02:30,880
Didn't he give you money?

63
00:02:31,960 --> 00:02:33,160
Can you just leave me alone?

64
00:02:37,400 --> 00:02:38,600
Men are all jerks.

65
00:02:44,280 --> 00:02:44,800
Let go of me.

66
00:02:45,200 --> 00:02:46,080
Let go of me!

67
00:02:47,040 --> 00:02:48,000
Let go!

68
00:03:33,160 --> 00:03:34,240
Why did you come back?

69
00:03:38,040 --> 00:03:39,400
I know you love ice cream.

70
00:03:40,240 --> 00:03:41,440
So I bought a bunch of flavors.

71
00:03:41,920 --> 00:03:42,560
For you.

72
00:03:47,200 --> 00:03:47,600
Su Yan.

73
00:03:49,640 --> 00:03:50,160
Tell me.

74
00:03:51,280 --> 00:03:53,040
What would make you feel better?

75
00:03:55,040 --> 00:03:55,640
Kiss me.

76
00:04:33,360 --> 00:04:33,840
You're up.

77
00:04:34,800 --> 00:04:35,560
I made breakfast.

78
00:04:40,600 --> 00:04:41,760
You cleaned all this up?

79
00:04:42,200 --> 00:04:42,480
Yeah.

80
00:04:44,320 --> 00:04:45,200
What time did you get up?

81
00:04:45,600 --> 00:04:46,040
Six.

82
00:04:46,480 --> 00:04:47,160
I always wake up at six.

83
00:04:47,560 --> 00:04:48,640
A habit I picked up in juvie.

84
00:04:51,080 --> 00:04:51,640
Drink some water first.

85
00:04:52,040 --> 00:04:52,520
It's warm.

86
00:05:23,360 --> 00:05:24,040
Are you a neat freak?

87
00:05:24,560 --> 00:05:25,000
A little.

88
00:05:25,440 --> 00:05:26,680
But you can make a mess.

89
00:05:26,920 --> 00:05:27,640
I'll clean it up.

90
00:05:30,360 --> 00:05:31,400
