I just made wontons. Try some.

92
00:05:41,880 --> 00:05:42,640
This is so good.

93
00:05:44,560 --> 00:05:45,880
I used to make them for my mom.

94
00:05:46,160 --> 00:05:47,080
From now on, I can...

95
00:05:47,080 --> 00:05:47,960
What are your plans?

96
00:05:48,320 --> 00:05:48,880
School?

97
00:05:49,600 --> 00:05:51,280
Or do you want to learn a trade?

98
00:05:51,800 --> 00:05:52,680
I can help with either.

99
00:05:55,800 --> 00:05:56,360
Try this.

100
00:05:57,080 --> 00:05:58,080
A soft-boiled egg.

101
00:05:58,840 --> 00:05:59,960
Don't change the subject.

102
00:06:00,640 --> 00:06:02,400
I'm not changing the subject.

103
