108
00:06:32,120 --> 00:06:34,000
A man can support the woman he loves.

109
00:06:34,720 --> 00:06:36,440
So why can't a woman do the same?

110
00:06:36,640 --> 00:06:38,160
(Support the man she likes.)

111
00:06:38,680 --> 00:06:40,000
(She said she likes me.)

112
00:06:40,720 --> 00:06:41,600
(No, no.)

113
00:06:45,280 --> 00:06:46,360
