114
00:06:47,280 --> 00:06:48,160
I can take care of myself.

115
00:06:50,040 --> 00:06:50,640
From now on,

116
00:06:51,040 --> 00:06:51,720
I'll work hard

117
00:06:51,720 --> 00:06:52,640
