118
00:07:06,840 --> 00:07:08,360
So you're really into that cute kid?

119
00:07:10,440 --> 00:07:11,080
No.

120
00:07:11,520 --> 00:07:13,160
A nineteen-year-old boy

121
00:07:13,160 --> 00:07:14,920
