122
00:07:15,400 --> 00:07:16,040
Perfectly normal.

123
00:07:16,560 --> 00:07:17,640
Spend money on him if you want.

124
00:07:17,640 --> 00:07:18,360
Enjoy the eye candy.

125
00:07:18,760 --> 00:07:19,760
Just don't catch feelings.

126
00:07:20,400 --> 00:07:21,400
I won't.

127
00:07:23,520 --> 00:07:24,720
He's like this ice cream.

128
00:07:25,240 --> 00:07:25,960
Sweet.

129
00:07:26,440 --> 00:07:27,080
Refreshing.

130
00:07:27,840 --> 00:07:28,840
Perfect for cooling me off.

131
00:07:29,600 --> 00:07:30,680
But I won't overindulge.

132
00:07:32,480 --> 00:07:33,200
I used to

133
00:07:33,200 --> 00:07:34,240
give others 80% of my love

134
00:07:34,240 --> 00:07:35,440
and keep only 20% for myself.

135
00:07:36,000 --> 00:07:36,680
But now,

136
00:07:37,800 --> 00:07:39,080
I want to keep 80% for myself.

137
00:07:41,920 --> 00:07:42,160
Okay.

138
00:07:45,440 --> 00:07:46,620
=The One=

139
