She's recovering well.

140
00:07:47,680 --> 00:07:48,680
She should be discharged soon.

141
00:07:48,680 --> 00:07:49,600
Okay. Thank you.

142
00:07:49,680 --> 00:07:50,440
I'll get back to work.

143
00:07:50,920 --> 00:07:51,600
I used to

144
00:07:51,880 --> 00:07:53,000
give others 80% of my love

145
00:07:53,960 --> 00:07:54,880
and keep only 20% for myself.

146
00:07:55,400 --> 00:07:55,960
But now,

147
00:07:56,720 --> 00:07:57,800
I want to keep 80% for myself.

148
00:07:58,120 --> 00:07:59,920
(But if I love,
I love with everything I have.)

149
00:07:59,920 --> 00:08:01,600
(And I expect the same.)

150
